(7537666, 1205616, 163081, '<td valign="top">I am not a fan of flower shots, and was afraid to see a whole bunch of them in this challenge. This one however kept my attention. Why? Those petals looks so small compared to the peduncle, and the little yellow stamen standing in the middle. The overall tones are just a little dark. I don''t know the ISO used, (looks quite high) but there seem to be a grain not suitable in this type of picture. A6 from me.</td>', 'I am not a fan of flower shots, and was afraid to see a whole bunch of them in this challenge. This one however kept my attention. Why? Those petals looks so small compared to the peduncle, and the little yellow stamen standing in the middle. The overall tones are just a little dark. I don''t know the ISO used, (looks quite high) but there seem to be a grain not suitable in this type of picture. A6 from me.', '2017-10-03 15:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
