(7537796, 1205918, 62357, '<td valign="top">I personally loathe selective colour adjustments and will never score an image high when presented in this way.  I cannot think of a case where the use of selective colour really enhances a photo.  Aside from the colour issue, I would like to have seen something in focus.  The blurred background is nice, but the foreground elements are not in focus and as they form the main subject of the photo it''s really hard to get past those.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I personally loathe selective colour adjustments and will never score an image high when presented in this way.  I cannot think of a case where the use of selective colour really enhances a photo.  Aside from the colour issue, I would like to have seen something in focus.  The blurred background is nice, but the foreground elements are not in focus and as they form the main subject of the photo it''s really hard to get past those. ', '2017-10-04 08:13:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7537797, 1206028, 124815, '<td valign="top">I was your 7 - great color</td>', 'I was your 7 - great color', '2017-10-04 08:24:38.000000', NULL, 0),
