(7537866, 1205918, 163081, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 5. <br/>I played around with in camera effects in the past and believe me, they are far from perfect. <br/>When viewing this image on a 27inch monitor at home it just looks awful. On a smaller screen it doesn''t look that bad. The contrast of deep red and black doesn''t seem to fit in this picture. <br/>I think that low to mid 4 is the right score.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I gave you a 5. I played around with in camera effects in the past and believe me, they are far from perfect. When viewing this image on a 27inch monitor at home it just looks awful. On a smaller screen it doesn''t look that bad. The contrast of deep red and black doesn''t seem to fit in this picture. I think that low to mid 4 is the right score. ', '2017-10-04 14:56:17.000000', NULL, 0),
