(7537930, 1205543, 50641, '<td valign="top">Did you know <a href="https://www.huffingtonpost.com/entry/praying-mantises-eating-birds-brains_us_59610ff4e4b0d5b458eac95e" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">they eat hummingbirds</a>?  Yes, it''s an eye candy eat eye candy world. Perfect balance on your focus/dof, congrats on a gruesome feat!</td>', 'Did you know they eat hummingbirds?  Yes, it''s an eye candy eat eye candy world. Perfect balance on your focus/dof, congrats on a gruesome feat!', '2017-10-05 00:50:08.000000', NULL, 0),
